# SnapServe UI

When designing, reviewing, or polishing dashboard / landing / docs UI:

1. Read `design-system/snapserve/MASTER.md` first.
2. Use `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max` for style, UX, chart, icon, and stack searches.
3. Never invent a new palette or font pairing. Tokens live in `artifacts/dashboard/src/index.css`.
4. Official mark is the three-bar logo + Tex Gyre Heros wordmark. Inter is UI type.
5. Do not use this skill to restyle Hyperframes films.
